        "id": 1947461
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-06-01T02:28:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes\nBut, in my understanding, updating mIsDefaultNetworkActive is atomic operation.\nSo handler thread can have `mIsDefaultNetworkActive\u003dtrue/false` without lock unless they change the value to intermediate state.",
      "parentUuid": "042017bc_5ce2769e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 11218,
        "startChar": 19,
        "endLine": 11218,
        "endChar": 42
